      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BookBot - WhatsApp Bookstore Sales Assistant\nAI sales assistant for a bookstore, working over WhatsApp.\n\n**Flow:** WhatsApp Trigger receives a customer message, the AI Agent decides what to do, and WhatsApp Business Cloud sends the reply.\n\n**Agent parts:**\n- OpenAI Chat Model: the reasoning model\n- Simple Memory: short chat history per customer phone number\n- Inventory tools: search_inventory, update_inventory\n- Order tools: create_order, search_orders, order_update (plus legacy Get all orders, Delete Order, cancle Order)\n- Customer tools: customer_search, customer_create, customer_update\n- Cart and sales tools: cart_search, cart_add, cart_update, sale_record\n- send_email: Gmail order emails\n\n**Setup:** connect WhatsApp, OpenAI, Google Sheets and Gmail credentials, set the spreadsheet and phone number ID, and choose the missing sheet tabs on the cart tools and orderItem_create (currently unconnected).",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 712
      },
