    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "Search the Orders Google Sheet.\n\nUse this tool whenever order information is required.\n\nAlways use this tool before:\n\n- Tracking an order\n- Updating an order\n- Cancelling an order\n- Creating a replacement order\n- Sending an order update email\n\nSearch using the Order ID whenever it is available.\n\nIf an Order ID is not provided, search using the customer's email address.\n\nReturn the complete order record, including:\n\n- Order ID\n- Book Name\n- Quantity Ordered\n- Customer Name\n- Customer Email\n- Order Date\n- Order Status\n- Unit Price (USD)\n- Total Price (USD)\n- Delivery Address\n- Delivery Estimate\n\nOrder Status may be one of:\n\n- Pending\n- Processing\n- Shipped\n- Delivered\n- Cancelled\n\nBusiness Rules\n\nIf Order Status = Pending\nâ¢ Address may be changed.\nâ¢ Quantity may be changed (subject to stock availability).\nâ¢ Order may be cancelled.\n\nIf Order Status = Processing\nâ¢ Address may be changed.\nâ¢ Quantity may be changed (subject to stock availability).\nâ¢ Order may be cancelled.\n\nIf Order Status = Shipped\nâ¢ No modifications are allowed.\nâ¢ No cancellation is allowed.\nâ¢ Only tracking information may be provided.\n\nIf Order Status = Delivered\nâ¢ No modifications are allowed.\nâ¢ No cancellation is allowed.\nâ¢ Inform the customer that the order has already been delivered.\n\nIf Order Status = Cancelled\nâ¢ Do not allow any modifications.\nâ¢ Do not reactivate the order.\nâ¢ Offer to create a replacement order instead.\nâ¢ Before creating the replacement order, ask the customer to confirm or update:\n  - Customer Name\n  - Customer Email\n  - Delivery Address\n\nNever invent order information.\n\nAlways retrieve the latest information from the Orders sheet before responding.\n",
